% Rekindle CLI

## Install

```console
mix igniter.install rekindle --integration gpui --targets web,desktop
```

## Tooling

```console
mix rekindle.setup
mix rekindle.setup web
mix rekindle.setup desktop
mix rekindle.doctor
mix rekindle.check
```

## Development

```console
mix phx.server
mix rekindle.dev
mix rekindle.dev web
mix rekindle.dev desktop
mix rekindle.dev web,desktop
mix assets.build
mix rekindle.build web
mix rekindle.build desktop
```

## Production

```console
mix rekindle.build web --release
mix rekindle.build desktop --release
mix assets.deploy
mix precommit
```
